README.md
# Institutional Knowledge Graph Relationships

Relationships define how entities interact within the Legibility Office Institutional Operating System (IOS).

While entities describe **what exists**, relationships describe **how institutions function**.

---

## Relationship Domains

- Governance
- Procurement
- Capability
- Digital Public Infrastructure
- AI Governance
- Institutional Memory
- Interoperability
- Finance
- Risk
- Policy
- Standards
- Coordination

---

