With both entities/ and relationships/ in place, your knowledge graph reaches a mature semantic structure:

Ontology
      │
      ▼
Entities
      │
      ▼
Relationships
      │
      ▼
Institutional Knowledge Graph
      │
      ▼
Institutional Intelligence
      │
      ▼
AI Assistants
      │
      ▼
Governance Analytics

This separation mirrors best practices in enterprise knowledge graphs and graph databases (e.g., Neo4j, RDF/OWL), making the IOS ready for semantic reasoning, dependency analysis, interoperability mapping, and future AI-powered institutional decision support.
